      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Following the launch of teacher-led Gemini Notebook in Google Classroom , we are introducing insight summaries for educators.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This functionality is only available for Gemini Notebooks assigned through Google Classroom, and students will see a notification in the assigned notebook informing them that their conversations in their assigned notebook are visible to their teacher.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Additionally, Google Workspace administrators can now enable external sharing for Gemini Notebook using granular controls in the Admin console , including Trusted Domains .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For example, this now allows Classroom users to create and assign notebooks if teachers and students are in different domains that are designated as trusted domains , if sharing with trusted domains is enabled by admins.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Teachers must be in a group or OU with Gemini Notebook set to On in order to create and assign a notebook, and view insight summaries.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Visit the Help Center to learn more about managing Gemini Notebook sharing settings , including Trusted Domains.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini Notebook insight summaries will be available if Gemini Notebook is enabled by your admin, and if students have interacted with an assigned Gemini Notebook.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
        "source": "Google Workspace Updates",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-19T20:23:52.002Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.041Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Insight summaries: Rapid Release and Scheduled Release domains: Full rollout (1–3 days for feature visibility) starting on October 19, 2026",
        "sourceUrl": "https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/2026/10/teacher-led-gemini-notebook-in-google-Classroom-now-offers-insight-summaries-for-educators-and-updated-sharing-settings-for-admins-including-trusted-domains.html",
